   "roundness": null,
   "text": "docs/requirements/register.md   one markdown table, one row per requirement\ndocs/requirements/categories.md the twenty-category disposition\n\nplain text. the project's own git repo. no index, no database,\nno shadow copy, no sync step. a model reads and WRITES a\nrequirement with Read/Edit \u2014 no tool invocation in the capture path.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "docs/requirements/register.md   one markdown table, one row per requirement\ndocs/requirements/categories.md the twenty-category disposition\n\nplain text. the project's own git repo. no index, no database,\nno shadow copy, no sync step. a model reads and WRITES a\nrequirement with Read/Edit \u2014 no tool invocation in the capture path.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
