   "text": "nothing.\n\ntools/ is 10,112 lines of stdlib-only Python across 35 files\nwith no dependency manifest of any kind. AU7/AU8 add no\nCI step \u2014 they ride gate.py audit, on the AU5/AU6 precedent.",
