   "roundness": null,
   "text": "the progress board and the journey pages, which already exist.\nprogress_kit.derive() counts len(gates_kit.audit(root)) today, so\na new check appears on the board for free.\n\nNOT delivered, and this is categorical rather than incremental:\nno write-back UI \u00b7 no PDF \u00b7 no ReqIF \u00b7 no baselines \u00b7 no\nconcurrency story beyond merge conflicts.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the progress board and the journey pages, which already exist.\nprogress_kit.derive() counts len(gates_kit.audit(root)) today, so\na new check appears on the board for free.\n\nNOT delivered, and this is categorical rather than incremental:\nno write-back UI \u00b7 no PDF \u00b7 no ReqIF \u00b7 no baselines \u00b7 no\nconcurrency story beyond merge conflicts.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
